# The same single isolated TIP4P-FQ molecule, geometry and parameter file as in.gas_slater, solved under
# the cube-root kernel (`fix_modify chg shield cbrt`) for comparison: run 0, SCF-solved dipole.
# water4_gas_slater.param carries the RAW zeta
# parameters (gamma column = zeta, 1/Angstrom -- see that file's header comment). lr_alpha defaults to 0
# (short-range path) -> exercises FixQEqBaseSam::compute_H via the calc_Hval override, NOT
# shielded_coulomb() (that needs lr_ewald>=2).
units           metal
atom_style      full
boundary        f f f
region          box block -20 20 -20 20 -20 20
create_box      3 box
