neighbor        2.0 bin
fix             chg fq qeq/sam 1 0.0 12.0 1.0e-9 water4_gas_slater.param
fix_modify      chg shield cbrt
samqeq: lr-solve shielding = cbrt J_shield (param 4th col = gamma); routed through compute_H + add_fixed_charge_field + the gas path (calc_Hval)
compute         dip  all dipole/samqeq
run             0

